# Mutation cases for the `<content expr>` of a `<final>`'s `<donedata>` that names
# one value, in a `datamodel="sce-static"` machine generated as Kotlin
# (docs/SCE_ACCEPTED_SUBSET.md §2.15).
#
# Run with
# `scripts/mutate sce-build/tests/mutations/a_static_kotlin_donedata_content_value_is_the_whole_event_data_kotlin.cases`.
#
# The expression is Kotlin the lowering wrote, read from the machine's own fields
# when the state is entered, and the template only places it: the value is the
# done event's whole data as the JSON `valueToJson` writes (`4`, `"tally"`). A
# value that cannot be computed — a checked multiplication that overflows — is the
# evaluation that failed (W3C SCXML 5.5): `error.execution` is raised and the
# empty string is the content's value.
#
# What is easy to get wrong and reads as success: the zero of a failed value is a
# done event that looks complete, and the text of a value in place of its JSON is
# a number that is right and a string that has lost its quotes. The scenarios
# `static_donedata_content_value`, `_text` and `_lost` tell them apart.
#
# The template reaches the tests only through the committed tree the
# regeneration writes, so the tree is a declared target and the command is what
# carries a mutated template into it.
#
# Anchors are literal slices of the source; an edit that moves one is reported
# INCONCLUSIVE with the anchor quoted, never as a pass.

mutation_gradle . :sce-kotlin-tests:test --tests 'com.sce.integration.StaticScenarioTest'
mutation_targets tools/codegen/templates/kotlin/entry_exit_actions.kt.jinja2
mutation_targets backends/kotlin/tests/src/main/kotlin/com/sce/integration/static_donedata_content/static_donedata_contentSm.kt
mutation_regen scripts/regen_static_datamodel_kotlin.sh
mutation_oracles backends/kotlin/tests/src/test/kotlin/com/sce/integration/StaticScenarioTest.kt sce-build/tests/fixtures/static_datamodel/scenarios/static_donedata_content_value.json sce-build/tests/fixtures/static_datamodel/scenarios/static_donedata_content_text.json sce-build/tests/fixtures/static_datamodel/scenarios/static_donedata_content_lost.json sce-build/tests/fixtures/static_datamodel/static_donedata_content.scxml

# ── A value that cannot be computed is the empty string ────────────

mutation_case "a donedata content value that failed is the zero of its type, not the empty string" <<'PY'
edit("tools/codegen/templates/kotlin/entry_exit_actions.kt.jinja2",
     "                        valueToJson(\"\")\n                    }\n{% else %}\n                    doneEventData = valueToJson(",
     "                        valueToJson(0)\n                    }\n{% else %}\n                    doneEventData = valueToJson(")
PY

# ── The value is the JSON it is ────────────────────────────────────

mutation_case "a donedata content value is the text of the value, not its JSON" <<'PY'
edit("tools/codegen/templates/kotlin/entry_exit_actions.kt.jinja2",
     "{% else %}\n                    doneEventData = valueToJson({{ state.donedata.native_content_value }})\n",
     "{% else %}\n                    doneEventData = valueToWireString({{ state.donedata.native_content_value }})\n")
PY
